                  <img src="/assets/img/projects/pixle/feature.webp" alt="Pixle AI Facial Recognition Platform for Event Photo Delivery main project preview" width="1600" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
                </div>
                <div class="floating-card card-primary">
                  <span class="eyebrow">Image AI</span>
                  <strong>Large image batches were converted into searchable, user-specific delivery flows instead of manual sorting work.</strong>
                </div>
