            <article class="stat-card"><strong>250k+</strong><span>Images processed across major event ingestion windows</span></article><article class="stat-card"><strong>-90%</strong><span>Manual sorting effort compared with traditional event delivery workflows</span></article><article class="stat-card"><strong>10k+</strong><span>Users served from personalized gallery access across active events</span></article><article class="stat-card"><strong><2 min</strong><span>Average indexing turnaround for new uploads entering recognition pipelines</span></article>
